  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "omnifall",
  "description": "\n\n\n  \n\n\n\n  \n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tOmniFall: A Unified Benchmark for Staged-to-Wild Fall Detection\n\t\n\nOmniFall is a comprehensive fall detection benchmark with dense temporal segment annotations across three components: OF-Staged (8 public lab datasets), OF-In-the-Wild (genuine accidents from OOPS), and OF-Synthetic (12,000 diffusion-generated videos with demographic diversity). All components share a sixteen-class activity taxonomy.[Paper] [Project Page]\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tQuickstart\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tLabels only (no\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/simplexsigil2/omnifall.",
  "alternateName": [
    "simplexsigil2/omnifall",
    "OmniFall: A Unified Benchmark for Staged-to-Wild Fall Detection"
  ],
